inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"description\":\"guy Harris provided a clean, professional, conversational voiceover for the European Collaboration Summit's big 2020 conference. Find out more!\",\"uploadDate\":\"2020-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"European Collaboration Summit"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A clear, conversational style of voiceover for this European Collaboration Summit promo.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Professional Voiceover for the 2020 European Collaboration Summit</h2>\r\n<p>I've actually provided voiceover for the European Collaboration Summit once before, with my classic <a href=\"/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"European Collaboration Summit Patrick Stewart Voice\">Patrick Stewart Voice</a>. So, given how well the last video worked out, I was more than happy to work with them again. They wanted a very different style for this video, but there was still plenty of humour throughout the script, so I had a great time with it. This is my softer, natural voiceover style, and it's a great for this kind of advertisement, but it's especially good for <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a> where you need the information to be as clear as possible.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Avsn2i7m8oY","title":"European Collaboration Summit","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/european-collaboration-summit-tickets-voiceover.jpg","alt":"european-collaboration-summit-tickets-voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A little more about the European Collab Summit 2020</h2>\r\n<p>The European Collaboration Summit is a major European modern workplace event about everything related to office work, incluing things like Office 365, Teams, SharePoint, Power Platform, and a huge range of business apps. It's essentially the best place in the world to attend if you're looking for new tools to increase your office's productivity. They put on a new summit each year and it's always well attended. I like the effort they put into their ads and I'm always happy to work with these guys. Check out their website in the link above and find out if the summit is what you've been looking for to take your business to the next level. And, if you need to know how to book a ticket, just watch this video again!</p>\r\n"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you're working on a new <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>, <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, or something else altogether, and you need a high-quality professional voiceover artist, then please feel free to get in touch. I am always happy to consider new work and I'm more than happy to provide you with a free voiceover sample from your script to help you hear whether my voice is right for your particular project. It might also interest you to know that I can usually return my recorded voiceover to you on the same day it's requested, which is perfect for anyone on a tight schedule.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"European Collaboration Summit","pageUrl":"european-collaboration-summit-tickets-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","986",{"href":"/draw-slasher-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/draw-slasher-game-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Draw Slasher Game Voiceover – Trailer and Character Voices","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Draw Slasher Game Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L3","674",{"href":"/eze-group-explainer-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/eze-group-explainer-voice.jpg","alt":"Eze Group Explainer Voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Eze Group Explainer Voice"}]]}],["$","$L3","883",{"href":"/the-official-voice-of-santa","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/official-voice-of-santa-guy-harris.jpg","alt":"the-official-voice-of-santa","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Guy Harris is the Official Voice of Santa"}]]}]]}]}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","$6","childr